(3) After pooled nuisance runs and O11's cost arms, §8 5.1 prices the ε-sized probe above half of a session's wall time (O11's threatens-B point), so B cannot run at ε. What is brought: the per-window variance, the windows per area per half, the wall share, and the ε at which the cost falls below half.
